    "status": "finding",
    "summary": "23 vehicles have registry rows DisabledDamageThreshold and ClearDisabledDamageThreshold, always equal to each other and to the own Field_6497ebc7: 400 for the two tanks and the CB90, 500 for the UH60, 300 for all others. The own Field_1a7c18f1 holds a lower number on 19 of them. With registry defaults in use a tank is critical below 400 health, which replaces the 200-and-400 reading offered in L3347. 135 raw-offset checks matched.",
